Provenance and modifications:

This opencode agent is derived from the "ponytail-review" agent skill
(skills/ponytail-review/SKILL.md) of https://github.com/dietrichgebert/ponytail.
The skill's YAML frontmatter was dropped because agent Markdown files carry
opencode agent configuration there instead; the body became the agent's system
prompt with these modifications by demiourgoi:

- A hard read-only restriction (the skill's soft closing line "Lists findings,
  changes no code." was removed) with a single exception: the review file named
  by the task.
- Guidance for the three review subjects of the ponytail-review-pdd skill
  (technical design, implementation-step code diff, whole implementation)
  and for reading a codebase summary index first when the task names one.
- The report must be written to the review file and replied with, findings can
  be missing or broken requirements, and design findings point at design
  sections. Section 3 ("Check before you report") is kept verbatim.

As a derivative of an MIT-licensed work it remains licensed under MIT. Full
license text: https://opensource.org/licenses/MIT and LICENSES/MIT.txt in the
source repository. The "ponytail-review-pdd" skill in this repository launches
this agent. Read-only enforcement is reinforced by the agent's permission
rules in .opencode/opencode.json.
